[standards/technology/eks/STD-TEC-EKS-003-helm.md#32-labeling-standards]

### 3.2 Labeling Standards

All Kubernetes resources must include standard labels:

```yaml
metadata:
  labels:
    {{- include "fusion-auth-api.labels" . | nindent 4 }}
    app.kubernetes.io/component: api
    app.kubernetes.io/part-of: fusion-idaas
```

Required labels (defined in `_helpers.tpl`):

```yaml
{{- define "fusion-auth-api.labels" -}}
helm.sh/chart: {{ include "fusion-auth-api.chart" . }}
{{ include "fusion-auth-api.selectorLabels" . }}
{{- if .Chart.AppVersion }}
app.kubernetes.io/version: {{ .Chart.AppVersion | quote }}
{{- end }}
app.kubernetes.io/managed-by: {{ .Release.Service }}
app.kubernetes.io/instance: {{ .Release.Name }}
{{- end }}
```

