[standards/technology/eks/STD-TEC-EKS-003-helm.md#52-conditional-resource-creation]

### 5.2 Conditional Resource Creation

Use conditional blocks for optional resources:

```yaml
{{- if .Values.ingress.enabled -}}
apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: Ingress
metadata:
  name: {{ include "fusion-auth-api.fullname" . }}
  labels:
    {{- include "fusion-auth-api.labels" . | nindent 4 }}
  {{- with .Values.ingress.annotations }}
  annotations:
    {{- toYaml . | nindent 4 }}
  {{- end }}
spec:
  # ... ingress spec
{{- end }}
```

