[standards/technology/eks/STD-TEC-EKS-003-helm.md#53-value-validation]

### 5.3 Value Validation

Include value validation in templates:

```yaml
{{- if not .Values.config.database.host }}
{{- fail "Database host must be specified in .Values.config.database.host" }}
{{- end }}

{{- if not .Values.secrets.database.password }}
{{- fail "Database password must be specified in .Values.secrets.database.password" }}
{{- end }}
```
